# Build-context exclusions (context = autoresearch/, Dockerfile = service/Dockerfile).
# `**/` patterns so the nested service/.venv is excluded too: the host test venv
# must NEVER enter the image — its scripts carry host-path shebangs that break
# `uv run uvicorn` inside the container.
**/.venv
**/venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/*.egg-info

# Runtime state — the SQLite job store and per-job workspaces never belong in
# the image; both are created on demand under $RESEARCH_*_DIR.
service/data/workspaces
service/data/jobs.db*
